1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,940
I'm impressed by the kid.

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:03,460
I want to get to know him better.

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,630
Whatever floats your boat.

4
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:05,970
Not my type.

5
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:07,730
Happy Birthday, Instructor Thear.

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,070
I told you I'd take care
of this one myself.

7
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,510
So why the hell are you trying
to steal him from me?

8
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:13,840
Stop fighting already.

9
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,370
You guys are friends, dammit.

10
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,470
I'm not his friend.

11
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:19,440
And I'll do
whatever it takes to beat you.

12
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,380
Master.

13
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:21,920
I want him to love me.

14
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,920
There might be a way.

15
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:25,700
But are you willing to trade

16
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:30,090
all the good luck
you'll ever have in your life

17
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,410
for him?

18
00:03:13,150 --> 00:03:14,740
Please root for me,

19
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:15,970
honey.

20
00:03:40,250 --> 00:03:43,070
(Yin as Theartha)

21
00:03:47,890 --> 00:03:50,580
(War as Mungkorn)

22
00:03:55,130 --> 00:03:57,170
(Shane as Phuwin)

23
00:03:57,740 --> 00:04:00,670
(Boss as Lukplub)

24
00:04:03,110 --> 00:04:04,780
(Kit as Kanin)

25
00:04:05,110 --> 00:04:07,010
(Tang as Nadol)

26
00:04:10,490 --> 00:04:15,710
(Tae as Saming)

27
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:46,970
Why did you bring me here?

28
00:04:48,890 --> 00:04:52,780
Like I told you,
if you want to get ahead in your career,

29
00:04:53,470 --> 00:04:54,740
there's a shortcut.

30
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:58,680
A shortcut? What kind of shortcut?

31
00:04:59,910 --> 00:05:01,350
Do you trust me?

32
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:05,430
I mean, seeing how well you're doing,
of course I do.

33
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,720
If you trust me,

34
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:10,340
you have to do exactly as I say,

35
00:05:11,850 --> 00:05:15,080
and your life
will never be the same again.

36
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:02,740
(Have this when you wake up
to help with your hangover.)

37
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:38,650
(I've ironed a cool outfit for you.)

38
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:13,580
(I've prepared warm water for you.
Enjoy your bath, Thear.)

39
00:07:19,410 --> 00:07:20,330
Master,

40
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,810
I've brought him here.

41
00:07:23,150 --> 00:07:24,890
He's the one I told you about,

42
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,820
the one who wanted
to have a ritual performed with you

43
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:29,140
to help him get ahead in his career.

44
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,350
With looks like these...

45
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:35,820
I understand why.

46
00:07:37,030 --> 00:07:39,080
What do my looks
have to do with anything?

47
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:40,010
Well...

48
00:07:41,130 --> 00:07:42,990
He probably means...

49
00:07:43,340 --> 00:07:45,570
you don't look much like a cop.

50
00:07:51,650 --> 00:07:53,010
Come closer.

51
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:58,640
Are you doing it, too?

52
00:07:58,860 --> 00:08:00,460
I thought you'd already done it.

53
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,170
I've done it, but I can do it again.

54
00:08:02,810 --> 00:08:04,820
It'll make my luck even stronger.

55
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,130
Hold his hand.

56
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,490
Mungkorn,

57
00:08:19,870 --> 00:08:21,220
if you want your mom
to have a better life

58
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:24,010
and want to get promoted,

59
00:08:24,780 --> 00:08:26,200
you have to trust me.

60
00:08:28,540 --> 00:08:29,260
Okay?

61
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:32,420
Okay.

62
00:09:03,190 --> 00:09:04,340
Saming...

63
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:07,660
I have a really bad feeling about this.

64
00:09:08,230 --> 00:09:09,970
I think we should stop here.

65
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,360
We can't, Mungkorn.

66
00:09:12,130 --> 00:09:13,320
We're already here.

67
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:15,180
If you quit halfway,

68
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,090
it'll bring a curse upon you.

69
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:22,530
Please stop. I'm leaving.

70
00:10:04,890 --> 00:10:09,040
I have commanded his soul
to be infatuated with you.

71
00:10:09,100 --> 00:10:15,860
All that remains is
for you to unite your body

72
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,520
with his.

73
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:24,860
Then Mungkorn will be bound to you
as your soulmate for eternity.

74
00:10:47,410 --> 00:10:48,100
Mungkorn...

75
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:50,240
Are you okay?

76
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:52,380
I am.

77
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:57,600
I'm glad you agreed
to go through with the ritual.

78
00:10:58,640 --> 00:10:59,620
From now on,

79
00:11:00,070 --> 00:11:02,690
your life will only get better,

80
00:11:03,010 --> 00:11:04,440
both in your career

81
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:08,170
and your love life.

82
00:11:09,910 --> 00:11:13,580
Thank you for caring so much about me.

83
00:11:14,210 --> 00:11:16,100
I've cared about you all this time.

84
00:11:16,830 --> 00:11:18,170
You just never noticed.

85
00:11:19,580 --> 00:11:20,910
I'm sorry.

86
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,330
The Golden Face Blessing ritual
is actually good.

87
00:11:30,380 --> 00:11:32,810
The master said it boosts your energy.

88
00:11:33,230 --> 00:11:35,580
Whatever you do,
people will feel compassion for you

89
00:11:36,090 --> 00:11:37,360
and take a liking to you.

90
00:11:37,690 --> 00:11:40,150
Oh, if it's about making people like me,

91
00:11:40,830 --> 00:11:42,080
I don't need that.

92
00:11:43,470 --> 00:11:46,160
As long as you love me,
that's more than enough.

93
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:50,210
You even brought me to Chiang Mai
for a ritual with a renowned master.

94
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,730
Actually, this shrine...

95
00:11:52,750 --> 00:11:54,510
handles both white and black magic.

96
00:11:54,540 --> 00:11:55,890
A lot of police officers come here.

97
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,160
Many of them practice the occult.

98
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,280
Some get sacred tattoos
for invulnerability.

99
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,700
Others come to enhance their luck.

100
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:02,230
Some even perform love spells.

101
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:07,340
Well, you don't need any love spells.

102
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:10,390
I'm already head over heels for you.

103
00:12:10,860 --> 00:12:12,280
If I didn't have you,

104
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,000
how would I even survive?

105
00:12:14,430 --> 00:12:17,650
You wouldn't,
and I wouldn't let you live without me.

106
00:12:41,090 --> 00:12:42,620
Wow.

107
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,410
A romantic khantoke dinner?

108
00:12:46,050 --> 00:12:47,910
What version of Theartha is this?

109
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:51,850
Obviously, it's the crazy-in-love one.

110
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,560
Isn't this a bit much?

111
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:56,070
Well, it's not just that.

112
00:12:56,100 --> 00:12:58,180
You see, Mungkorn prepared everything

113
00:12:58,210 --> 00:13:00,070
for me this morning,

114
00:13:00,450 --> 00:13:03,440
so I wanted to give him
a little surprise, too.

115
00:13:04,370 --> 00:13:05,210
Is this enough?

116
00:13:05,230 --> 00:13:06,960
Will there be
a traditional dance performance?

117
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:08,820
Hey, how did you know about that?

118
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:10,380
I've kept it a secret.

119
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:11,840
I'll give you a little sneak peek.

120
00:13:12,020 --> 00:13:13,180
Just a teaser.

121
00:13:13,890 --> 00:13:21,260
♪Swaying gently, swaying along,
nice and easy as we go♪

122
00:13:21,290 --> 00:13:23,690
I guess love really does make people
lose their minds.

123
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:25,680
What?

124
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,400
I'd better get going.

125
00:13:31,590 --> 00:13:32,470
Thear.

126
00:13:33,290 --> 00:13:34,370
He's a good one.

127
00:13:35,350 --> 00:13:36,880
You've changed yourself so much for him.

128
00:13:39,410 --> 00:13:41,090
Make sure you don't let him go.

129
00:13:48,170 --> 00:13:49,960
♪Swaying gently...♪

130
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:33,590
Oh, honey.

131
00:14:35,790 --> 00:14:37,600
Why are you home so late?

132
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:41,720
I've been waiting for you for so long
I'm about to drift off to sleep.

133
00:14:43,450 --> 00:14:44,890
I was working.

134
00:14:45,830 --> 00:14:46,630
It's okay.

135
00:14:46,970 --> 00:14:48,840
I'd wait a lifetime for you.

136
00:14:49,970 --> 00:14:51,080
Come here.

137
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:54,590
Stand right there for a second.

138
00:14:57,110 --> 00:14:58,120
Please take a seat.

139
00:15:01,780 --> 00:15:03,150
Aren't you even a little happy?

140
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:05,930
Here, I arranged a special khantoke set

141
00:15:06,060 --> 00:15:07,710
just for my special someone.

142
00:15:08,210 --> 00:15:10,290
It's all from
the most famous spots in Chiang Mai.

143
00:15:10,860 --> 00:15:14,050
You prepared
everything for me this morning,

144
00:15:14,650 --> 00:15:16,840
so I wanted to take care of you, too.

145
00:15:18,220 --> 00:15:19,840
Here's the first bite.

146
00:15:20,700 --> 00:15:21,990
Served right to you.

147
00:15:22,970 --> 00:15:23,620
Open wide.

148
00:15:24,140 --> 00:15:25,580
I've already had dinner.

149
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:35,160
Oh, and how did you get home?

150
00:15:35,420 --> 00:15:37,540
Why didn't you call me?

151
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,080
I could've picked you up.

152
00:15:39,170 --> 00:15:40,670
Saming gave me a ride.

153
00:15:41,260 --> 00:15:41,960
What?

154
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:46,430
Hey, you let him bring you here?

155
00:15:46,830 --> 00:15:48,310
Then he knows we're living together.

156
00:15:48,890 --> 00:15:50,010
It's fine.

157
00:15:50,830 --> 00:15:52,120
I trust him.

158
00:15:52,340 --> 00:15:53,940
But I don't.

159
00:15:54,170 --> 00:15:55,530
That's your problem, Inspector.

160
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:03,600
Hey, wait.

161
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:05,560
You could at least eat some.

162
00:16:05,590 --> 00:16:06,860
I ordered so much food.

163
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:08,380
I'm not hungry.

164
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:17,660
Mungkorn...

165
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:36,840
Hey.

166
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:39,190
You took your ring off.

167
00:16:39,310 --> 00:16:40,330
You probably forgot to wear it.

168
00:16:42,270 --> 00:16:43,430
You should wear it while you're at home.

169
00:16:45,210 --> 00:16:46,380
I don't want to wear it.

170
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,510
It's tight

171
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:51,850
and uncomfortable.

172
00:16:53,410 --> 00:16:54,650
Is something wrong?

173
00:16:55,870 --> 00:16:57,560
Did I do something wrong?

174
00:16:58,440 --> 00:16:59,680
Nothing's wrong.

175
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:01,860
I'm just tired.

176
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:06,920
Is there anything I can help you with?

177
00:17:10,110 --> 00:17:11,200
Is it about work?

178
00:17:11,690 --> 00:17:13,990
The reason you let Saming drop you off

179
00:17:14,170 --> 00:17:17,400
is because you want to get close to him
for the case, right?

180
00:17:18,570 --> 00:17:20,800
There's nothing
to investigate about him.

181
00:17:22,570 --> 00:17:23,860
I was just mistaken.

182
00:17:24,930 --> 00:17:26,200
What do you mean by that?

183
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:30,130
You're acting really strange today.

184
00:17:31,350 --> 00:17:33,470
Is something on your mind?
You can tell me.

185
00:17:34,210 --> 00:17:36,040
Or are you putting on some kind of act?

186
00:17:36,650 --> 00:17:38,140
I really can't keep up with you.

187
00:17:38,550 --> 00:17:40,390
I'm not putting on an act.

188
00:17:41,570 --> 00:17:44,760
I'm just doing exactly what I want to.

189
00:17:45,470 --> 00:17:46,500
Or maybe...

190
00:17:47,010 --> 00:17:49,630
Is it this?

191
00:17:56,770 --> 00:17:58,730
There's no wiretap
or anything like that.

192
00:18:00,110 --> 00:18:02,330
Stop thinking the worst of Saming.

193
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:09,110
I don't know what's gotten into you,

194
00:18:09,630 --> 00:18:12,100
but there's no way
I'll ever trust Saming.

195
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:16,540
I'll prove to you

196
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:18,740
what his true colors are.

197
00:18:42,130 --> 00:18:44,000
What kind of coffee do you like?

198
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:46,130
I like it strong.

199
00:18:46,870 --> 00:18:48,030
No sugar.

200
00:18:48,970 --> 00:18:50,750
I don't really like it sweet.

201
00:18:51,450 --> 00:18:52,340
That's perfect.

202
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:53,980
I'll keep that in mind

203
00:18:54,410 --> 00:18:56,460
so I can make it for you every day.

204
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:01,460
Here you go.

205
00:19:02,110 --> 00:19:03,360
Would you like a sandwich, too?

206
00:19:03,390 --> 00:19:04,550
I bought it for you.

207
00:19:04,570 --> 00:19:06,570
I'm telling you. It's amazing.

208
00:19:10,810 --> 00:19:11,880
Is it good?

209
00:19:12,270 --> 00:19:13,280
Very good.

210
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:15,090
Wait.

211
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:18,170
Your collar is a mess.

212
00:19:18,570 --> 00:19:19,800
Let me fix it for you.

213
00:19:23,970 --> 00:19:24,690
Oops!

214
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,970
What's going on here?

215
00:19:26,990 --> 00:19:29,080
Am I missing some gossip?

216
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:31,700
Hold on, are you two...

217
00:19:32,580 --> 00:19:33,790
dating?

218
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:35,800
No, we're not dating.

219
00:19:36,250 --> 00:19:37,910
I'm still trying to win his heart.

220
00:19:38,980 --> 00:19:40,760
I don't know if he falls for me yet.

221
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:43,910
How could I not fall
for someone like you?

222
00:19:44,250 --> 00:19:48,180
Aw, you guys are cute.

223
00:19:50,310 --> 00:19:52,060
That's fabulous. Don't worry.

224
00:19:52,090 --> 00:19:55,500
Love is always a beautiful thing.

225
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,220
What are you looking at?

226
00:19:58,250 --> 00:19:59,790
Have a crush on me?

227
00:20:01,690 --> 00:20:03,640
Hello, Inspector.

228
00:20:04,950 --> 00:20:08,520
See? You didn't make a move on Mungkorn,

229
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,510
so someone else swooped right in
and snatched him up.

230
00:20:29,190 --> 00:20:30,470
Don't you think it's weird?

231
00:20:31,390 --> 00:20:33,410
I know they're friends,

232
00:20:33,470 --> 00:20:35,020
but isn't this too much?

233
00:20:36,210 --> 00:20:37,220
I agree.

234
00:20:37,250 --> 00:20:39,580
That's not the look in Mungkorn's eyes
that I remember.

235
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:42,340
It's like he's a different person.

236
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,350
Mungkorn,

237
00:20:52,020 --> 00:20:53,350
are you serious right now?

238
00:20:56,410 --> 00:20:57,450
Serious about what?

239
00:20:57,470 --> 00:20:58,770
About Saming, obviously.

240
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:01,080
Enough already.

241
00:21:01,370 --> 00:21:02,470
I'm jealous.

242
00:21:02,610 --> 00:21:03,690
I really am.

243
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:06,010
I don't know
what else you want me to prove.

244
00:21:06,530 --> 00:21:08,450
I don't need you to prove anything

245
00:21:09,330 --> 00:21:10,220
because you...

246
00:21:10,830 --> 00:21:12,520
aren't even on my mind.

247
00:21:14,070 --> 00:21:16,210
I want to prove to everyone

248
00:21:16,370 --> 00:21:20,440
that Saming has nothing to do
with the Black Bull.

249
00:21:22,330 --> 00:21:25,090
What did he do
to make you change your mind suddenly?

250
00:21:25,210 --> 00:21:26,470
Overnight, to be exact.

251
00:21:27,270 --> 00:21:28,620
Well, tell me.

252
00:21:28,990 --> 00:21:30,390
What makes him better than me?

253
00:21:32,450 --> 00:21:33,880
Pretty much everything.

254
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:47,080
But I am your legally wedded husband.

255
00:21:48,360 --> 00:21:49,700
So legally speaking,

256
00:21:50,550 --> 00:21:52,090
I can get a divorce, right?

257
00:21:54,130 --> 00:21:56,020
Because I want my own life back.

258
00:21:57,700 --> 00:21:59,270
Why would you say that?

259
00:22:00,550 --> 00:22:02,170
I'm just being honest.

260
00:22:17,950 --> 00:22:19,790
Did you have to push me that hard?

261
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:32,170
You think something's off
about Mungkorn, too, right?

262
00:22:32,900 --> 00:22:35,690
Yeah, he hasn't been himself lately.

263
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:38,560
Something is definitely up.

264
00:22:38,810 --> 00:22:40,590
Don't take this the wrong way,

265
00:22:40,900 --> 00:22:42,250
but it's like...

266
00:22:42,280 --> 00:22:44,190
He's under some kind of spell, right?

267
00:22:46,450 --> 00:22:47,560
Why are you here?

268
00:22:49,170 --> 00:22:50,820
We came here for a trip,

269
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:54,320
but we happened to
run into Saming and Mungkorn

270
00:22:54,700 --> 00:22:56,100
at a black magic shrine

271
00:22:56,130 --> 00:22:57,590
that's popular with cops.

272
00:22:59,530 --> 00:23:00,220
Phuwin...

273
00:23:01,550 --> 00:23:02,630
Isn't that Mungkorn over there?

274
00:23:03,390 --> 00:23:05,710
How did Saming end up with Mungkorn?

275
00:23:06,810 --> 00:23:07,700
Mungkorn!

276
00:23:09,890 --> 00:23:10,730
Phuwin?

277
00:23:11,550 --> 00:23:13,190
I didn't expect to see you here.

278
00:23:13,670 --> 00:23:15,240
- I just came...
- Well...

279
00:23:15,270 --> 00:23:17,130
I brought him here to pray.

280
00:23:21,550 --> 00:23:23,290
Right, Saming.

281
00:23:23,740 --> 00:23:25,380
This is Lukplub, my boyfriend.

282
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:26,660
Hello.

283
00:23:26,870 --> 00:23:27,670
Hello.

284
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:30,420
I heard your boyfriend was cute.

285
00:23:30,750 --> 00:23:32,690
Didn't think
he'd be this cute in person.

286
00:23:33,530 --> 00:23:35,640
I brought Phuwin here
for the Golden Face Blessing ritual.

287
00:23:36,420 --> 00:23:38,220
I was planning to drop by the station.

288
00:23:38,410 --> 00:23:40,560
I didn't expect to run into you here.

289
00:23:40,960 --> 00:23:42,090
What about the others?

290
00:23:42,610 --> 00:23:43,670
Where's Inspector Thear?

291
00:23:44,170 --> 00:23:45,420
He's just doing his thing.

292
00:23:46,130 --> 00:23:47,610
Why are you asking me about him?

293
00:23:53,200 --> 00:23:55,040
Should we grab a meal together sometime?

294
00:23:55,590 --> 00:23:56,950
I've been missing everyone.

295
00:23:57,090 --> 00:23:57,970
I'd rather not.

296
00:23:59,100 --> 00:24:00,710
I'm having dinner with Saming.

297
00:24:02,260 --> 00:24:04,500
(I think Mungkorn
is definitely under a spell.)

298
00:24:06,250 --> 00:24:08,060
When did he start acting so weird?

299
00:24:08,870 --> 00:24:10,550
I'd say since yesterday.

300
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:13,110
He gave me the cold shoulder
when he got home.

301
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:14,200
- What?
- What?

302
00:24:14,770 --> 00:24:15,630
Wait a second.

303
00:24:16,540 --> 00:24:18,640
Why would Mungkorn be at your place?

304
00:24:25,170 --> 00:24:27,770
They are actually married.

305
00:24:29,860 --> 00:24:31,190
Mungkorn told me that.

306
00:24:31,970 --> 00:24:33,420
Hold on a second.

307
00:24:33,680 --> 00:24:35,070
Mungkorn is under a spell,

308
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,830
and he's also married.

309
00:24:37,020 --> 00:24:38,310
I can't keep up with this.

310
00:24:40,730 --> 00:24:41,720
Here's what happened.

311
00:24:44,180 --> 00:24:47,730
My mom had me marry him

312
00:24:47,980 --> 00:24:49,340
to turn my luck around.

313
00:24:49,890 --> 00:24:51,600
I thought I'd just go along with it

314
00:24:51,630 --> 00:24:52,950
to put her mind at ease.

315
00:24:53,100 --> 00:24:55,050
We'd get divorced after six months.

316
00:24:57,350 --> 00:24:58,940
But as we lived together,

317
00:25:00,600 --> 00:25:02,450
I actually fell for him.

318
00:25:04,090 --> 00:25:05,250
I mean, look at him.

319
00:25:06,410 --> 00:25:07,880
How could I not fall for him?

320
00:25:08,570 --> 00:25:09,550
By now,

321
00:25:09,970 --> 00:25:11,900
he's become a part of my life.

322
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,970
I figured as much.

323
00:25:23,060 --> 00:25:24,610
I've noticed it for a while now.

324
00:25:26,510 --> 00:25:28,950
Why did he tell you but not me, though?

325
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:32,720
Well, maybe
I'm more trustworthy than you.

326
00:25:35,180 --> 00:25:36,600
What the hell, Thear?

327
00:25:36,830 --> 00:25:38,380
You seriously kept this from me?

328
00:25:38,410 --> 00:25:40,580
Damn, I'm supposed to be
your best friend.

329
00:25:41,040 --> 00:25:43,420
I trusted you to make sure
no one would flirt with him,

330
00:25:43,490 --> 00:25:44,670
but you just took him for yourself.

331
00:25:47,330 --> 00:25:48,460
It's okay.

332
00:25:49,800 --> 00:25:53,120
We'll get Mungkorn
back to his normal self.

333
00:25:53,270 --> 00:25:54,450
But first of all,

334
00:25:54,620 --> 00:25:57,280
he must come with us
to have the spell removed.

335
00:25:57,670 --> 00:26:00,480
From the look of it,
I doubt he'll come with us.

336
00:26:00,800 --> 00:26:02,590
He's infatuated with Saming.

337
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:05,650
Hey.

338
00:26:07,410 --> 00:26:09,040
That oracle your mom asked for help...

339
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:11,460
Will she be able to help?

340
00:26:29,560 --> 00:26:31,710
Is there any way you can help?

341
00:26:32,070 --> 00:26:35,110
Mungkorn has become
a completely different person.

342
00:26:35,860 --> 00:26:37,420
The magic being used...

343
00:26:38,100 --> 00:26:39,500
is black magic.

344
00:26:40,720 --> 00:26:42,060
The longer it lasts,

345
00:26:42,390 --> 00:26:44,300
the more it will affect Mungkorn.

346
00:26:46,080 --> 00:26:48,340
The dark magic will eventually

347
00:26:48,930 --> 00:26:50,080
consume him,

348
00:26:50,450 --> 00:26:52,490
and he'll forget who you are.

349
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,510
But don't be afraid.

350
00:26:57,010 --> 00:26:59,340
Your fates are still entwined.

351
00:27:00,350 --> 00:27:02,060
Luckily, he's stubborn.

352
00:27:02,900 --> 00:27:04,540
His soul is fighting it from within,

353
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:06,780
calling out for only you.

354
00:27:07,990 --> 00:27:10,340
That means there's a way

355
00:27:10,370 --> 00:27:12,710
I can get my Mungkorn back, right?

356
00:27:13,770 --> 00:27:15,820
May the love you shared in a past life

357
00:27:16,150 --> 00:27:17,750
be awakened

358
00:27:18,190 --> 00:27:20,970
and brought back to you.

359
00:27:23,550 --> 00:27:25,180
Even if things

360
00:27:25,700 --> 00:27:27,340
can never be the same again,

361
00:27:28,280 --> 00:27:30,740
may the heaven and earth bear witness

362
00:27:32,230 --> 00:27:34,140
that you two

363
00:27:34,610 --> 00:27:35,860
are destined to be together,

364
00:27:36,500 --> 00:27:38,020
never to be parted.

365
00:27:48,030 --> 00:27:49,160
Sugar palm seeds?

366
00:27:51,900 --> 00:27:53,410
What else? This one?

367
00:27:56,860 --> 00:27:58,250
What can I get for you?

368
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:01,150
Oh, I haven't seen you in ages!

369
00:28:01,270 --> 00:28:03,760
Wow, you two are still so in love.

370
00:28:03,870 --> 00:28:05,940
Are you going to
book my place out again?

371
00:28:06,360 --> 00:28:07,570
Not today, thanks.

372
00:28:07,590 --> 00:28:09,580
We're in a rush. It's just a quick stop.

373
00:28:10,050 --> 00:28:13,650
I'll have the grass jelly,
sugar palm seeds,

374
00:28:13,670 --> 00:28:16,220
and a mix of red and green syrups

375
00:28:16,250 --> 00:28:17,270
with lots of condensed milk, please.

376
00:28:17,290 --> 00:28:17,930
Two bowls.

377
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:20,000
Coming right up.

378
00:28:20,610 --> 00:28:21,750
Just a moment.

379
00:28:21,770 --> 00:28:22,710
See?

380
00:28:23,080 --> 00:28:24,610
I even remembered your favorite recipe.

381
00:28:24,890 --> 00:28:26,020
You told me

382
00:28:26,050 --> 00:28:28,270
you were taking me
on a routine inspection.

383
00:28:29,320 --> 00:28:31,230
Why did you bring me
to a shaved ice place?

384
00:28:32,310 --> 00:28:34,410
We're supposed to be on duty.

385
00:28:37,330 --> 00:28:40,510
Just getting
a little refreshment before work.

386
00:28:45,840 --> 00:28:51,280
(Shaved ice)

387
00:28:54,290 --> 00:28:55,310
Mungkorn,

388
00:28:55,800 --> 00:28:56,810
aren't you going to eat?

389
00:28:57,590 --> 00:28:59,290
Hey, this is your favorite.

390
00:29:00,430 --> 00:29:02,660
We were here together

391
00:29:03,280 --> 00:29:04,880
after you were discharged
from the hospital.

392
00:29:04,990 --> 00:29:05,910
Don't you remember?

393
00:29:07,730 --> 00:29:09,170
You told me

394
00:29:09,200 --> 00:29:12,510
the shaved ice here
made you feel so much better.

395
00:29:14,900 --> 00:29:16,260
You said it yourself.

396
00:29:35,710 --> 00:29:37,990
It's too sweet. I don't like it.

397
00:29:42,420 --> 00:29:43,180
Listen,

398
00:29:43,890 --> 00:29:45,600
we made a promise to each other

399
00:29:45,790 --> 00:29:47,450
that if we survived,

400
00:29:47,790 --> 00:29:49,990
we would have shaved ice here together.

401
00:29:50,710 --> 00:29:52,220
It means a lot to me,

402
00:29:53,050 --> 00:29:54,950
but if you can't remember, it's alright.

403
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:56,950
I'll make you remember eventually.

404
00:29:57,530 --> 00:29:58,270
So...

405
00:29:59,040 --> 00:30:00,400
come on, let me feed you.

406
00:30:02,620 --> 00:30:03,320
Just one bite.

407
00:30:03,350 --> 00:30:04,780
I told you I don't like it.

408
00:30:06,620 --> 00:30:07,930
Is it too bland?

409
00:30:07,970 --> 00:30:09,500
Maybe I need to spice things up.

410
00:30:16,910 --> 00:30:18,490
I'll wait in the car.

411
00:30:18,950 --> 00:30:20,450
Once you're done,

412
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:22,650
we can get back to work.

413
00:30:23,190 --> 00:30:26,490
(You must take him back
to the places you've been before)

414
00:30:26,730 --> 00:30:29,420
(and do the things
you used to do with him.)

415
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:31,510
(Make him remember everything.)

416
00:30:31,810 --> 00:30:35,610
(Every sight, taste, scent, and sound.)

417
00:30:55,380 --> 00:30:57,010
Why did you bring me to a waterfall?

418
00:30:58,470 --> 00:30:59,610
Is there a case here?

419
00:31:00,810 --> 00:31:03,940
Yeah. This place is a campsite.

420
00:31:04,620 --> 00:31:06,300
There might be
some drug deals going down.

421
00:31:08,020 --> 00:31:09,220
Oh, and this...

422
00:31:10,050 --> 00:31:12,050
is where we've been together before.

423
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:13,770
Do you remember?

424
00:31:14,400 --> 00:31:15,930
You're asking me this again?

425
00:31:16,700 --> 00:31:18,410
Why do you want to know that so badly?

426
00:31:18,560 --> 00:31:19,830
I just want to do my job.

427
00:31:46,830 --> 00:31:48,490
- Whoa, hey!
- Hey!

428
00:31:48,630 --> 00:31:49,170
Stop.

429
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:51,370
(Please just let me
be a good husband for once.)

430
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:54,760
Mungkorn...

431
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:58,150
You remember this place, don't you?

432
00:31:59,030 --> 00:32:01,190
This is where we came to swim

433
00:32:01,210 --> 00:32:02,310
and camp together.

434
00:32:06,060 --> 00:32:06,950
This...

435
00:32:07,870 --> 00:32:11,780
is where I made you feel so warm,

436
00:32:12,390 --> 00:32:14,330
like you were being showered with love
from the whole world.

437
00:32:16,970 --> 00:32:19,200
Is it even possible
for someone to feel that way?

438
00:32:19,840 --> 00:32:21,020
Of course it is.

439
00:32:21,650 --> 00:32:22,910
It's possible when you're in love.

440
00:33:00,650 --> 00:33:01,990
What are you trying to do?

441
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:07,030
You remember everything
about us now, right?

442
00:33:14,420 --> 00:33:15,650
I want to go home.

443
00:33:17,270 --> 00:33:18,280
Hey, wait.

444
00:33:19,850 --> 00:33:20,730
You know what?

445
00:33:20,760 --> 00:33:23,120
We should spend the night
camping here together.

446
00:33:23,750 --> 00:33:24,710
I can't.

447
00:33:25,990 --> 00:33:27,270
I have plans with Saming.

448
00:33:28,460 --> 00:33:30,170
Why would you want to be with him?

449
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:31,980
He's hurting you.

450
00:33:33,060 --> 00:33:34,720
He has never hurt me.

451
00:33:36,040 --> 00:33:37,310
You're the only one

452
00:33:37,900 --> 00:33:39,250
who's hurting both of us.

453
00:33:41,390 --> 00:33:42,590
I'm leaving.

454
00:34:09,050 --> 00:34:09,940
Hey.

455
00:34:11,290 --> 00:34:12,740
I need some help.

456
00:34:18,020 --> 00:34:19,150
Come on, cheers!

457
00:34:27,720 --> 00:34:29,370
Guys, Mungkorn is here.

458
00:34:29,520 --> 00:34:31,790
Hey, my brother! Come on in.

459
00:34:31,820 --> 00:34:32,600
Sit down.

460
00:34:32,630 --> 00:34:33,440
- Let's have a chat.
- Hi.

461
00:34:33,470 --> 00:34:34,780
- Take a seat.
- Come on.

462
00:34:36,590 --> 00:34:38,170
Why did we have to meet up today?

463
00:34:38,860 --> 00:34:40,680
Well, it's a Friday night!

464
00:34:40,710 --> 00:34:43,120
We've got to have some fun.

465
00:34:43,490 --> 00:34:45,620
I'll mix drinks for both of you.

466
00:34:48,550 --> 00:34:49,980
I don't have a problem with it,

467
00:34:50,630 --> 00:34:52,690
but I haven't even said yes.

468
00:34:52,970 --> 00:34:54,770
And somehow he made me come here.

469
00:35:03,180 --> 00:35:05,130
Besides, I haven't told Saming yet.

470
00:35:05,670 --> 00:35:08,020
We told Inspector Thear
to bring you here.

471
00:35:08,380 --> 00:35:10,410
Since you've been acting strange,

472
00:35:10,610 --> 00:35:12,760
we wanted to spend more time with you.

473
00:35:12,910 --> 00:35:15,630
Or have you forgotten about us already?

474
00:35:16,130 --> 00:35:18,910
Exactly, especially
after all we've been through together.

475
00:35:19,110 --> 00:35:20,460
I haven't.

476
00:35:21,330 --> 00:35:22,350
I remember everything.

477
00:35:23,290 --> 00:35:26,130
Then why don't we
put your memory to the test?

478
00:35:27,280 --> 00:35:30,020
Do you remember who my partner is?

479
00:35:30,260 --> 00:35:31,590
It's Phuwin, obviously.

480
00:35:32,170 --> 00:35:32,830
Correct.

481
00:35:32,850 --> 00:35:34,480
Hey, what about mine?

482
00:35:34,630 --> 00:35:36,520
Do you remember who my partner is?

483
00:35:40,200 --> 00:35:41,210
Do you even have one?

484
00:35:43,140 --> 00:35:44,140
Well, not yet.

485
00:35:44,520 --> 00:35:45,680
But I'm about to.

486
00:35:47,400 --> 00:35:48,540
Very soon.

487
00:35:50,430 --> 00:35:51,450
Now is not your time.

488
00:35:51,980 --> 00:35:54,790
Fine, that was too easy.

489
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,460
Thear, ask him a question.

490
00:35:57,310 --> 00:35:58,370
Alright.

491
00:35:59,070 --> 00:36:01,300
Do you remember who your partner is?

492
00:36:10,310 --> 00:36:11,060
It's okay.

493
00:36:12,200 --> 00:36:13,600
Let's make it easier.

494
00:36:14,720 --> 00:36:16,000
Do you remember...

495
00:36:16,080 --> 00:36:19,420
what our first mission together was?

496
00:36:26,090 --> 00:36:28,600
The drug bust at a bar.

497
00:36:28,620 --> 00:36:30,220
- Whoa!
- Hey!

498
00:36:30,390 --> 00:36:31,370
That's correct.

499
00:36:31,450 --> 00:36:32,600
What about the second mission?

500
00:36:32,620 --> 00:36:34,110
Remember where we went?

501
00:36:37,230 --> 00:36:40,590
The house of the Black Bull agent.

502
00:36:41,100 --> 00:36:42,600
- Whoa!
- Hey!

503
00:36:43,110 --> 00:36:44,250
- There he goes.
- He's getting it.

504
00:36:49,390 --> 00:36:51,370
Why are you all so happy?

505
00:36:51,510 --> 00:36:52,870
Of course they're happy.

506
00:36:53,060 --> 00:36:54,970
These are all memorable events.

507
00:36:54,990 --> 00:36:56,610
And do you remember...

508
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:58,460
that you once got shot?

509
00:36:58,770 --> 00:36:59,460
Remember that?

510
00:37:04,420 --> 00:37:06,590
Back then, Inspector Thear

511
00:37:07,000 --> 00:37:09,350
stayed by your side
until you were fully recovered.

512
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:14,320
You know, he was worried sick about you.

513
00:37:39,400 --> 00:37:41,110
- It doesn't hurt too much, does it?
- No, it's fine.

514
00:37:44,340 --> 00:37:47,230
I'm your love, Inspector Thear?

515
00:38:08,600 --> 00:38:09,590
Mungkorn...

516
00:38:16,530 --> 00:38:18,220
You're drinking without me?

517
00:38:18,260 --> 00:38:21,250
If you didn't get invited,
it means you're not welcome here.

518
00:38:22,970 --> 00:38:24,070
Mungkorn,

519
00:38:24,540 --> 00:38:26,620
you didn't tell me
you wanted to hang out like this.

520
00:38:26,680 --> 00:38:28,100
I'll bring you here next time.

521
00:38:28,220 --> 00:38:30,420
Let's come here together next time.
Just you and me.

522
00:38:31,290 --> 00:38:32,200
Mungkorn.

523
00:38:33,120 --> 00:38:34,370
Come on, let's have some fun.

524
00:38:34,390 --> 00:38:35,470
The night is still young.

525
00:38:35,610 --> 00:38:36,260
Come on.

526
00:38:36,290 --> 00:38:37,200
Come on, Mungkorn.

527
00:38:37,220 --> 00:38:39,610
Fill up your glass. Let's drink.

528
00:38:40,120 --> 00:38:41,920
Wanna join us, Saming?

529
00:38:43,610 --> 00:38:44,460
Nah.

530
00:38:45,340 --> 00:38:47,390
I'd rather take you back home.

531
00:38:48,540 --> 00:38:51,370
I wish we could have
some time to ourselves.

532
00:38:54,030 --> 00:38:55,990
Then let's go home.

533
00:38:57,080 --> 00:38:57,830
Alright.

534
00:38:58,910 --> 00:38:59,950
Let's go.

535
00:39:08,590 --> 00:39:09,510
Mungkorn!

536
00:39:12,700 --> 00:39:14,830
Hey! Let go of him!

537
00:39:17,680 --> 00:39:18,960
What is it with you now?

538
00:39:19,670 --> 00:39:20,840
He chose to come with me.

539
00:39:20,870 --> 00:39:22,400
What the hell
does it have to do with you?

540
00:39:22,460 --> 00:39:25,030
How can you be so sure he chose you?

541
00:39:25,050 --> 00:39:27,600
You saw for yourself
he was hanging out with his friends.

542
00:39:27,860 --> 00:39:29,650
Then why don't you ask him

543
00:39:29,870 --> 00:39:32,370
if he wants to be
with his friends or with me?

544
00:39:35,300 --> 00:39:36,870
I'm leaving with Saming.

545
00:39:38,070 --> 00:39:39,270
You should just go.

546
00:39:39,560 --> 00:39:40,450
See?

547
00:39:40,890 --> 00:39:41,960
You heard him.

548
00:39:42,060 --> 00:39:44,200
Go drown your sorrows
with your friends.

549
00:39:44,490 --> 00:39:46,150
I don't want any trouble,

550
00:39:46,370 --> 00:39:48,540
especially since your luck
seems to be hitting rock bottom.

551
00:39:57,700 --> 00:39:58,850
I win.

552
00:39:59,960 --> 00:40:02,270
I'm taking Mungkorn for myself.

553
00:40:03,660 --> 00:40:06,660
Dammit, you f*cking played dirty.

554
00:40:10,420 --> 00:40:11,870
What the f*ck do you mean?

555
00:40:13,170 --> 00:40:14,260
Looking for a fight, huh?

556
00:40:15,190 --> 00:40:16,670
Leave Saming alone!

557
00:40:17,200 --> 00:40:18,140
Hey, stop.

558
00:40:18,170 --> 00:40:19,620
Thear, calm down!

559
00:40:21,940 --> 00:40:25,090
This is up to Mungkorn anyway, isn't it?

560
00:40:25,930 --> 00:40:28,210
You had someone precious
but couldn't keep him,

561
00:40:28,230 --> 00:40:30,020
so I had to step in.

562
00:40:30,310 --> 00:40:31,750
- Got it?
- Shut your damn mouth.

563
00:40:31,780 --> 00:40:32,770
- Thear!
- Mungkorn!

564
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:34,050
Don't go with him.

565
00:40:34,900 --> 00:40:36,970
Calm down. Let them go for now.

566
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:39,480
Phuwin, keep an eye on your friend.

567
00:40:39,860 --> 00:40:42,550
He looks just like a dog
chasing a motorcycle.

568
00:40:42,570 --> 00:40:45,510
- What the f*ck do you mean?
- Thear, stop!

569
00:40:45,530 --> 00:40:46,520
Get a grip.

570
00:40:46,570 --> 00:40:49,870
Dammit, you piece of sh*t! F*ck you.

571
00:40:49,980 --> 00:40:50,820
Inspector!

572
00:40:51,470 --> 00:40:52,250
Take it easy.

573
00:40:52,270 --> 00:40:52,990
Calm down.

574
00:40:54,290 --> 00:40:55,000
Hey.

575
00:40:55,740 --> 00:40:56,550
Calm down.

576
00:40:56,670 --> 00:40:57,760
I've already handled it.

577
00:40:57,780 --> 00:40:59,630
I planted a GPS tracker on his car.

578
00:41:09,220 --> 00:41:14,510
(PM 5473 Phayao)

579
00:41:25,360 --> 00:41:28,750
(PM 5473 Phayao)

580
00:41:29,520 --> 00:41:30,990
Make yourself at home.

581
00:41:31,680 --> 00:41:34,130
Your house is huge and very lovely.

582
00:41:34,850 --> 00:41:37,880
No matter how huge it is,
I still feel lonely.

583
00:41:38,730 --> 00:41:40,610
That's why I want someone
to stay with me.

584
00:41:42,570 --> 00:41:43,200
Come on.

585
00:41:44,930 --> 00:41:46,310
Let me show you my bedroom.

586
00:41:59,490 --> 00:42:00,190
(KN 48051 Chiang Mai)

587
00:42:04,540 --> 00:42:06,850
Saming's trying to pull Mungkorn

588
00:42:06,870 --> 00:42:08,470
into whatever shady sh*t
he's involved in.

589
00:42:08,590 --> 00:42:10,350
If he gets to sleep
with Mungkorn tonight,

590
00:42:10,500 --> 00:42:12,090
I don't think
things will end well for Mungkorn.

591
00:42:12,570 --> 00:42:13,710
What do you mean by that?

592
00:42:13,800 --> 00:42:16,990
Physical connection
is actually a spiritual matter.

593
00:42:17,440 --> 00:42:20,650
Once they make physical contact,
his black magic will be complete.

594
00:42:21,210 --> 00:42:22,090
Like...

595
00:42:22,120 --> 00:42:25,430
Oh, you mean
the body, mind, and soul theory?

596
00:42:26,690 --> 00:42:29,130
Right now, the spell
has only taken over Mungkorn's mind.

597
00:42:29,390 --> 00:42:31,440
But once it claims his body,

598
00:42:32,010 --> 00:42:33,620
his soul will belong to Saming.

599
00:42:33,820 --> 00:42:35,130
That was a very vivid explanation.

600
00:42:35,200 --> 00:42:36,750
Then let's figure out

601
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:38,910
how to stop them from sleeping together.

602
00:42:43,250 --> 00:42:46,310
Phuwin and Lukplub,
you go cut the power to his house.

603
00:42:46,820 --> 00:42:49,020
I doubt they can do much
if the lights are out.

604
00:42:49,200 --> 00:42:51,260
- Okay.
- You got it. We'll handle that.

605
00:42:51,280 --> 00:42:52,520
And after the lights go out?

606
00:42:52,950 --> 00:42:55,110
Just barge in and get him out of there?

607
00:42:55,440 --> 00:42:56,440
No.

608
00:42:57,450 --> 00:43:00,030
I'll try to make him remember
one more time.

609
00:43:00,050 --> 00:43:01,040
But you've already tried that.

610
00:43:01,070 --> 00:43:02,160
It didn't work, did it?

611
00:43:02,180 --> 00:43:03,330
I'm not giving up.

612
00:43:03,680 --> 00:43:06,150
I'll never let that bastard
take Mungkorn away from me.

613
00:43:09,300 --> 00:43:10,330
- Let's go.
- Okay.

614
00:43:28,590 --> 00:43:29,580
After you.

615
00:43:41,540 --> 00:43:44,990
It's finally just you and me.

616
00:43:46,380 --> 00:43:48,930
Things were getting in the way
at the bar.

617
00:43:49,550 --> 00:43:51,800
We barely got a moment alone.

618
00:43:54,140 --> 00:43:55,150
And...

619
00:43:56,830 --> 00:43:58,670
does it hurt a lot?

620
00:43:59,660 --> 00:44:00,570
Not at all.

621
00:44:01,910 --> 00:44:03,060
It was more than worth it

622
00:44:03,720 --> 00:44:05,760
to have you right here with me.

623
00:44:19,500 --> 00:44:20,790
Can I ask you something?

624
00:44:21,600 --> 00:44:22,640
What is it?

625
00:44:23,230 --> 00:44:24,910
Do you love Thear?

626
00:44:25,950 --> 00:44:27,290
Why do you ask?

627
00:44:28,810 --> 00:44:30,960
I want to know why you married him

628
00:44:31,940 --> 00:44:33,910
and how you feel about him.

629
00:44:35,540 --> 00:44:36,820
Do you love him?

630
00:44:38,450 --> 00:44:39,980
I married him

631
00:44:41,280 --> 00:44:43,140
purely for what I would get in return.

632
00:44:43,990 --> 00:44:45,320
For me,

633
00:44:45,890 --> 00:44:48,390
you're the one
I actually have feelings for.

634
00:44:52,300 --> 00:44:54,030
I feel the same way about you.

635
00:44:56,280 --> 00:44:57,080
Mungkorn...

636
00:44:57,740 --> 00:44:58,490
Yes?

637
00:44:58,810 --> 00:45:00,010
Divorce him.

638
00:45:01,830 --> 00:45:03,140
From now on,

639
00:45:03,560 --> 00:45:04,920
just tell me what you want,

640
00:45:05,340 --> 00:45:06,920
and I'll give you everything.

641
00:45:09,300 --> 00:45:10,520
Yes, Saming.

642
00:45:29,000 --> 00:45:30,310
Take the shirt off.

643
00:45:36,250 --> 00:45:37,710
I meant your shirt.

644
00:46:56,550 --> 00:46:58,150
You check this side.
I'll handle that one.

645
00:46:58,180 --> 00:46:58,850
Got it.

646
00:47:25,560 --> 00:47:26,520
Looks like a power outage.

647
00:47:28,810 --> 00:47:30,020
Stay right here.

648
00:47:31,280 --> 00:47:32,150
I'll be right back.

649
00:47:39,480 --> 00:47:40,280
Let's go.

650
00:47:49,840 --> 00:47:50,980
Where should we hide?

651
00:47:52,290 --> 00:47:53,010
Come here.

652
00:47:54,240 --> 00:47:54,990
Come on.

653
00:49:22,730 --> 00:49:24,450
A candle is a nice touch.

654
00:49:25,210 --> 00:49:26,640
It makes this more romantic.

655
00:49:27,260 --> 00:49:27,940
Alright.

656
00:49:28,390 --> 00:49:29,720
Let's pick up where we left off.

657
00:49:49,370 --> 00:49:54,610
♪I have a heart to give,
when will you receive it?♪

658
00:49:55,400 --> 00:49:59,290
♪Can you hear it?
My love, can you hear my wishes?♪

659
00:49:59,310 --> 00:50:01,620
Who the hell is playing music
this late at night?

660
00:50:01,640 --> 00:50:07,070
♪All of my heart,
I've kept it all for you,♪

661
00:50:07,500 --> 00:50:12,680
♪And all I want is
for it to belong to you♪

662
00:50:15,900 --> 00:50:21,190
♪If you ask how much I love you,
I'll let you know♪

663
00:50:21,240 --> 00:50:26,440
♪If you ask how much I care,
I'll tell you so♪

664
00:50:26,460 --> 00:50:31,740
♪I love you to the moon and back♪

665
00:50:31,760 --> 00:50:36,540
♪That's how much love I have packed♪

666
00:50:36,920 --> 00:50:43,130
♪About four hundred thousand miles,
or even more than that♪

667
00:50:48,280 --> 00:50:50,360
I'm going to take
that song you just played

668
00:50:50,520 --> 00:50:53,190
as our love confession.

669
00:51:10,700 --> 00:51:18,670
♪If you ask how much I love you,
I'll let you know♪

670
00:51:18,700 --> 00:51:24,400
♪If you ask how much I care,
I'll tell you so♪

671
00:51:25,100 --> 00:51:30,040
♪I love you to the moon and back♪

672
00:51:30,300 --> 00:51:31,100
Mungkorn...

673
00:51:33,630 --> 00:51:35,060
What's wrong? Tell me.

674
00:51:37,030 --> 00:51:37,870
Mungkorn?

675
00:51:38,650 --> 00:51:39,820
Why are you putting your shirt back on?

676
00:51:40,710 --> 00:51:41,940
Where are you going?

677
00:51:42,920 --> 00:51:44,460
Aren't you staying the night with me?

678
00:51:46,550 --> 00:51:48,440
I have to go home.

679
00:51:49,750 --> 00:51:52,440
I have a headache,
and I'm not feeling very well.

680
00:51:54,940 --> 00:51:56,330
Wait a second.

681
00:51:58,020 --> 00:52:00,210
We haven't even had any fun yet.

682
00:52:00,270 --> 00:52:01,430
Let's not do it.

683
00:52:01,510 --> 00:52:03,130
Come on, Mungkorn.

684
00:52:03,410 --> 00:52:05,230
- Stay and have some fun with me.
- Saming...

685
00:52:05,250 --> 00:52:07,080
- I really want to go home.
- Come on.

686
00:52:07,110 --> 00:52:08,450
Mungkorn, don't leave.

687
00:52:08,470 --> 00:52:10,370
Saming, I want to go home.

688
00:52:12,990 --> 00:52:13,860
Mungkorn!

689
00:52:24,190 --> 00:52:25,160
Mungkorn!

690
00:52:26,780 --> 00:52:27,790
Mungkorn, wait!

691
00:52:29,050 --> 00:52:30,020
Let me give you a ride.

692
00:52:30,040 --> 00:52:31,040
It's okay.

693
00:52:31,080 --> 00:52:32,550
- But...
- I'll get a ride home myself.

694
00:52:32,580 --> 00:52:34,440
But it's late now.

695
00:52:34,730 --> 00:52:36,650
- Let me give you a ride.
- I said I'm fine!

696
00:53:01,390 --> 00:53:02,330
Need a ride?

697
00:53:03,950 --> 00:53:04,610
Yes.

698
00:53:15,630 --> 00:53:16,640
Thank you.

699
00:54:34,280 --> 00:54:35,590
You look worried.

700
00:54:35,970 --> 00:54:37,010
Are you okay?

701
00:54:37,230 --> 00:54:38,260
I'm kinda worried.

702
00:54:38,660 --> 00:54:40,890
I have no idea what trick
Inspector Saming is going to pull next.

703
00:54:41,420 --> 00:54:43,100
I should have been able
to save Mungkorn,

704
00:54:43,360 --> 00:54:44,860
given everything I knew.

705
00:54:47,340 --> 00:54:49,380
I suspect that Saming...

706
00:54:50,210 --> 00:54:52,130
is working with the Black Bull.

707
00:54:53,310 --> 00:54:54,810
What makes you think that?

708
00:54:55,980 --> 00:54:59,050
It all started
when we were interrogating Tiannan.

709
00:54:59,420 --> 00:55:00,520
I just don't understand

710
00:55:00,550 --> 00:55:03,930
why he gave up the intel
to Saming so easily.

711
00:55:05,040 --> 00:55:07,130
But putting yourself
in that kind of relationship...

712
00:55:07,630 --> 00:55:09,140
is extremely risky.

713
00:55:11,420 --> 00:55:12,310
I know.

714
00:55:12,750 --> 00:55:15,340
That's why I'm giving you
this scrapbook.

715
00:55:16,210 --> 00:55:17,370
If anything happens,

716
00:55:18,030 --> 00:55:19,780
please give it to Inspector Thear.

717
00:55:22,970 --> 00:55:23,860
Take it easy.

718
00:55:24,990 --> 00:55:26,500
We're working on this together.

719
00:55:27,460 --> 00:55:29,520
Mungkorn will definitely be
one of us again.

720
00:55:44,760 --> 00:55:47,400
Are you wearing the amulet I gave you?

721
00:55:48,950 --> 00:55:49,770
Of course I am.

722
00:55:50,620 --> 00:55:53,850
I always do whatever you tell me to.

723
00:55:55,510 --> 00:55:57,980
But I think our plan for today is solid.

724
00:55:58,360 --> 00:55:59,730
Nothing's going to go wrong.

725
00:56:01,880 --> 00:56:03,480
I'm not so sure.

726
00:56:04,000 --> 00:56:05,500
We also had a good plan last time,

727
00:56:05,750 --> 00:56:07,730
but Mungkorn ended up getting shot.

728
00:56:08,670 --> 00:56:10,120
Physical protection is one thing,

729
00:56:10,500 --> 00:56:12,260
but having an amulet
for spiritual protection is good, too.

730
00:56:14,730 --> 00:56:18,640
You know, if anyone ever tried
to put a love spell on you,

731
00:56:20,660 --> 00:56:22,140
I wouldn't be able to stand it.

732
00:56:24,770 --> 00:56:25,950
Don't you worry.

733
00:56:26,590 --> 00:56:27,510
It wouldn't work anyway.

734
00:56:28,420 --> 00:56:31,150
I'm so under your spell
that nobody else can touch me.

735
00:56:36,490 --> 00:56:39,130
Anyway, where is Mungkorn?

736
00:56:39,150 --> 00:56:40,240
Didn't you two come together?

737
00:56:40,370 --> 00:56:41,720
He should be here soon.

738
00:56:42,350 --> 00:56:43,380
Is something the matter?

739
00:56:43,410 --> 00:56:45,540
You two have been acting strange lately.

740
00:56:47,500 --> 00:56:49,590
Someone came between us
and caused a misunderstanding.

741
00:56:52,990 --> 00:56:53,820
Oh, Sin!

742
00:56:53,910 --> 00:56:55,040
Have a seat here.

743
00:56:55,130 --> 00:56:57,050
- Good evening, sir.
- Hello. Have a seat.

744
00:56:57,270 --> 00:56:58,130
Thank you.

745
00:56:59,710 --> 00:57:01,350
Happy birthday, sir.

746
00:57:01,370 --> 00:57:04,150
May you live
for a hundred million years.

747
00:57:04,580 --> 00:57:06,540
Whoa, I don't need all those years.

748
00:57:06,570 --> 00:57:08,340
I'd be struggling just to get by
at a hundred.

749
00:57:08,520 --> 00:57:10,430
- Come on, cheers.
- Thank you, sir.

750
00:57:13,750 --> 00:57:14,660
Thear,

751
00:57:15,160 --> 00:57:17,080
regarding what you reported to me,

752
00:57:17,220 --> 00:57:18,510
you can make your move.

753
00:57:18,800 --> 00:57:21,150
Understood.
I won't let anything go wrong.

754
00:57:21,600 --> 00:57:24,290
Just be extra careful this time.

755
00:57:24,550 --> 00:57:26,570
You guys almost got killed last time.

756
00:57:32,870 --> 00:57:35,000
Oh, Mungkorn is here.

757
00:57:40,080 --> 00:57:42,460
Wait, isn't that your friend?

758
00:57:42,490 --> 00:57:43,670
I remember him.

759
00:57:44,120 --> 00:57:45,220
Inspector Saming, right?

760
00:57:45,630 --> 00:57:46,650
Yes, Mom.

761
00:57:47,190 --> 00:57:48,440
But he's no friend.

762
00:57:48,760 --> 00:57:49,560
He's an enemy.

763
00:57:49,680 --> 00:57:50,520
What?

764
00:57:51,620 --> 00:57:53,050
What happened, son?

765
00:57:54,980 --> 00:57:56,880
Why is he arm-in-arm
with Mungkorn like that?

766
00:57:57,010 --> 00:57:59,040
Why does Mr. Mungkorn look so drained?

767
00:57:59,320 --> 00:58:01,290
And why isn't he here with you?

768
00:58:02,230 --> 00:58:03,370
Don't worry, Mom.

769
00:58:04,710 --> 00:58:06,960
He'll be back with me no matter what.

770
00:58:12,160 --> 00:58:14,130
You didn't answer my calls last night.

771
00:58:14,580 --> 00:58:16,230
I was worried sick about you.

772
00:58:16,750 --> 00:58:17,910
I'm fine.

773
00:58:18,480 --> 00:58:20,220
Last night didn't go as planned.

774
00:58:21,540 --> 00:58:22,950
Let's find another chance.

775
00:58:23,160 --> 00:58:23,840
Please.

776
00:58:24,980 --> 00:58:25,760
Hey.

777
00:58:27,130 --> 00:58:29,110
Or you could just move in with me.

778
00:58:29,720 --> 00:58:31,480
That'd make things easier, wouldn't it?

779
00:58:31,620 --> 00:58:33,120
Who the hell invited you?

780
00:58:37,170 --> 00:58:38,520
Have some manners.

781
00:58:39,110 --> 00:58:41,050
This is your dad's birthday party.

782
00:58:42,050 --> 00:58:43,150
You can't act like a thug

783
00:58:43,170 --> 00:58:45,060
and punch me like you did at the bar.

784
00:58:46,330 --> 00:58:47,840
Show some respect for your family.

785
00:58:48,400 --> 00:58:49,900
Don't you dare lecture me.

786
00:58:50,660 --> 00:58:52,960
I know exactly what I'm doing,

787
00:58:53,040 --> 00:58:55,550
and I know exactly
what you're doing, too.

788
00:58:56,500 --> 00:58:58,420
But I bet you don't know...

789
00:58:59,170 --> 00:59:01,140
that he's moving in with me.

790
00:59:02,340 --> 00:59:03,530
Is that true, Mungkorn?

791
00:59:04,480 --> 00:59:05,970
Well, he asked me to.

792
00:59:07,040 --> 00:59:08,160
His house is huge.

793
00:59:09,680 --> 00:59:11,220
Things would be easier, too.

794
00:59:11,550 --> 00:59:12,250
But...

795
00:59:12,270 --> 00:59:14,840
Can't you just
respect his decision for once?

796
00:59:17,110 --> 00:59:18,100
Right, Mungkorn?

797
00:59:18,910 --> 00:59:19,590
Yes.

798
00:59:38,470 --> 00:59:39,960
Alright, everyone.

799
00:59:39,980 --> 00:59:41,500
Moving on to the next part.

800
00:59:41,530 --> 00:59:43,520
I'd like to express our gratitude

801
00:59:43,540 --> 00:59:46,870
to all the officers
and their spouses here.

802
00:59:46,890 --> 00:59:51,120
Thank you for joining us to celebrate

803
00:59:51,150 --> 00:59:55,460
Police General Panya's 72nd birthday.
He's already retired.

804
00:59:58,760 --> 01:00:01,890
Now, I'd like Police Major Thear
to come up on stage

805
01:00:01,920 --> 01:00:04,630
and offer his wishes
to Police General Panya.

806
01:00:04,660 --> 01:00:09,480
(Police General Panya Phiromsamorn)

807
01:00:17,420 --> 01:00:18,980
Good evening, everyone.

808
01:00:19,250 --> 01:00:21,330
First of all,
I'd like to thank all of you

809
01:00:21,360 --> 01:00:24,490
for coming to celebrate
my father's birthday.

810
01:00:24,880 --> 01:00:26,980
Now, I'd like to give my father
my best wishes.

811
01:00:28,140 --> 01:00:31,390
Dad, I wish you
great health and strength

812
01:00:31,410 --> 01:00:33,320
so you can stay with me, Mom,

813
01:00:33,440 --> 01:00:36,220
and all our family and colleagues
for a long time to come.

814
01:00:42,590 --> 01:00:43,920
And everyone,

815
01:00:44,170 --> 01:00:46,710
today isn't just about
celebrating my father's birthday.

816
01:00:46,770 --> 01:00:49,750
I'd also like to
officially introduce my life partner

817
01:00:49,780 --> 01:00:51,160
to all of you.

818
01:00:56,980 --> 01:00:58,110
Sergeant Mungkorn,

819
01:00:58,600 --> 01:00:59,450
come up here.

820
01:01:05,150 --> 01:01:05,890
Mungkorn,

821
01:01:06,320 --> 01:01:07,150
go on.

822
01:01:10,930 --> 01:01:11,990
Go up there.

823
01:01:15,530 --> 01:01:16,960
Can I get a round of applause, please?

824
01:01:26,290 --> 01:01:27,200
Ladies and gentlemen, meet...

825
01:01:28,000 --> 01:01:30,140
Pol.Snr.Sgt.Maj. Mungkorn Phianwanich.

826
01:01:34,230 --> 01:01:37,010
He is my legally wedded husband.

827
01:01:37,740 --> 01:01:38,740
Since when were they married?

828
01:01:42,200 --> 01:01:44,250
We have been married for a while now,

829
01:01:44,270 --> 01:01:46,770
but I haven't had the chance
to officially announce it.

830
01:01:46,840 --> 01:01:48,210
So tonight,

831
01:01:48,400 --> 01:01:50,970
I'd like to ask you to wish us

832
01:01:51,000 --> 01:01:53,490
a happy life together
with nothing standing in our way.

833
01:01:55,210 --> 01:01:57,480
May you all be witnesses to our promise

834
01:01:57,510 --> 01:01:58,660
to love

835
01:01:59,180 --> 01:02:01,070
and cherish each other forever.

836
01:02:05,230 --> 01:02:07,540
And no one will ever come between us

837
01:02:07,750 --> 01:02:10,440
or tear us apart.

838
01:02:43,650 --> 01:02:44,850
Don't do anything to Mungkorn.

839
01:02:44,870 --> 01:02:45,890
Just take it out on me.

840
01:02:47,370 --> 01:02:48,670
Saming, stop!

841
01:02:51,000 --> 01:02:52,000
Please...

842
01:02:52,030 --> 01:02:53,390
I'll do anything for you.

843
01:02:53,410 --> 01:02:55,440
I'll even marry you
if that's what you want.

844
01:02:55,470 --> 01:02:57,920
I told you. You'll never beat me.

845
01:03:02,090 --> 01:03:07,000
♪Trying so hard not to cross the line,♪

846
01:03:07,030 --> 01:03:11,860
♪But the more I run,
the more you're on my mind♪

847
01:03:11,880 --> 01:03:16,150
♪If you're gonna love me,
don't break the deal we made♪

848
01:03:16,180 --> 01:03:21,700
♪Don't break my heart,
remember what you said?♪

849
01:03:21,730 --> 01:03:26,600
♪Let's call off the deal
and let our hearts decide♪

850
01:03:26,630 --> 01:03:33,060
♪From contracting parties to lovers,
does that sound alright?♪

851
01:03:39,300 --> 01:03:42,690
♪It's time you became mine♪
